---
<section class="py-24 px-6 bg-bg">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">

    <span
      class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-muted font-sans block mb-10"
      data-animate
      data-delay="0"
    >/ WHO WE ARE</span>

    <h2
      class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-heading leading-tight mb-6"
      data-animate
      data-delay="0.15"
    >
      We're Not Going to Sell You More Leads.
    </h2>

    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-16" data-animate data-delay="0.3">

      <div class="space-y-6 text-body text-lg max-w-2xl flex-1">
        <p>
          Most marketing companies sell you more traffic. More ads. More exposure. We do the opposite.
        </p>
        <p>
          We find where the money you've already spent is going to waste — and we stop the bleeding. Every dollar you've invested in Google, in referrals, in your reputation already created real demand. The question is whether your business captures it at the moment someone decides.
        </p>
        <p>
          We find where that decision breaks. Then we fix it. That's all we do.
        </p>
        <p class="text-subtle text-base border-l-2 border-accent/30 pl-4 italic">
          Robbie Butt · Founder · Columbia, SC<br />
          <span class="not-italic text-muted text-sm">Two hundred and fifty million dollars in combined annual revenue. That's what the home service businesses in our portfolio produce today. Not one of them got there by spending more on ads. Every single one of them got there because we found where their marketing was already working — and built the system to stop it from leaking.</span>
          <br /><br />
          <span class="not-italic text-muted text-sm">Forty years. Zero cold calls. Every client came from results.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 lg:mt-0 lg:flex-shrink-0" data-animate data-delay="0.45">
        <img
          src="/img/robbie-butt.jpg"
          alt="Robbie Butt, Founder of EngageEngine™"
          width="224"
          height="224"
          class="w-48 h-48 lg:w-56 lg:h-56 object-cover object-top"
        />
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
